The office of a school in Bafoussam has three printing jobs:

(i) 400 copies of an exam paper that contains only text;
(ii) colour photographs for student identity cards;
(iii) multi-part receipts for school fees, with two carbon copies.

For each job, choose the most suitable type of printer (laser, inkjet or dot-matrix) and give a reason. (6 marks)
